# LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# Not a style preference. The content digests in third_party/*/CHECKSUMS.json
# and skill_memories/champions.lock.json are computed over LF content, and a
# working tree that git converted to CRLF fails its own integrity check on
# Windows for a reason that has nothing to do with integrity.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Patches must arrive byte-for-byte or they will not apply.
*.patch -text
*.diff -text

# Shipped artefacts are committed exactly as evaluated.
skill_memories/** -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
